    <item>
      <title>Investigators press ahead nearly three weeks on from Nancy Guthrie's disappearance</title>
      <link>https://www.nbcboston.com/news/national-international/week-three-nancy-guthrie-disappearance/3903740/</link>
      <description>TUCSON, ARIZONA – FEBRUARY 15: A makeshift memorial is seen outside of Nancy Guthrie’s residence on February 15, 2026 in Tucson, Arizona. Searches continue for Nancy Guthrie, the 84-year-old mother of U.S. journalist and television host Savannah Guthrie, after she went missing from her home on the morning of February 1st. The search enters its 3rd week with law enforcement officials claiming to have found several items of evidence, but having made no arrests.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nbcboston.com/news/national-international/week-three-nancy-guthrie-disappearance/3903740/</guid>
